  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A creamy, sharpenable long-wear lip liner that softly defines and shapes lips with a smooth glide and a comfortable feel.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-wearing</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Fractional Quartz: Enhances texture for an effortlessly smooth application.</p><p>- Jojoba Oil: Moisturizes to keep lips soft and smooth.</p><p>- Lip Grip Complex: Locks lip liner in place, no matter where the day takes you.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Glide pencil along your lip line to outline or define.<br>-Use to fill in lips.<br>-Use on its own or with your preferred lip products.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Isododecane, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Synthetic Wax, Polybutene, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Silica, Isoamyl Laurate, Sucrose Tetrastearate Triacetate, Hydrogenated Jojoba Oil, Cetearyl Behenate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Red 6 (CI 15850), Red 7 (CI 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090).</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A creamy, sharpenable long-wear lip liner that softly defines and shapes lips with a smooth glide and a comfortable feel.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-wearing</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Fractional Quartz: Enhances texture for an effortlessly smooth application.</p><p>- Jojoba Oil: Moisturizes to keep lips soft and smooth.</p><p>- Lip Grip Complex: Locks lip liner in place, no matter where the day takes you.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Glide pencil along your lip line to outline or define.<br>-Use to fill in lips.<br>-Use on its own or with your preferred lip products.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Isododecane, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Synthetic Wax, Polybutene, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Silica, Isoamyl Laurate, Sucrose Tetrastearate Triacetate, Hydrogenated Jojoba Oil, Cetearyl Behenate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Red 6 (CI 15850), Red 7 (CI 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090).</p></div></details>",
